<title>UK: London gold, silver end just up post data, PGMS off.</title>
<headline>London gold, silver end just up post data, PGMS off.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $340.30/$340.80, up 60 cents. Struggled back over $340.00 aided by overnight weakness in dollar. Short covering rally spurred by inflation-threatening U.S. GDP data.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished four cents firmer at $4.70/$4.72. Lifted on short covering post data. Sold into.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Quiet. Ended down $0.90 at $371.670/$372.60.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finished down $1.00 at $156.25/$157.25.</p>
</text>
